:INFO
Art. 29 Publication
The content of Annexes 1–3 is not published in the Official Compilation of Federal Legislation or the Systematic Compilation of Federal Legislation.
|

:INFO
Art. 30 Repeal of legislation
The Goods Control Ordinance of 25 June 1997 is repealed.
|

:NOTE
[AS 1997 1704; 1999 2471; 2000 187 Art. 21 No 11; 2002 349 No II; 2005 601 Annex 7 No 4, 3537; 2007 1469 Annex 4 No 63; 2008 5525 Annex 4 No II 3; 2009 6937 Annex 4 No II 22; 2011 3981; 2012 1703 Annex 6 No II 1, 1773, 6781 Attachment 2 No 4; 2014 2507, 4553; 2016 493]
